WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-03 - The Anchor's Weight
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Sanctuary (Zero-G) (2003)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.727
[Instrumental Intro — Classical Piano, Spatial Reverb & Fretless Bass]

00:00:45.727 --> 00:00:49.669
I can see the blue from a million miles away

00:00:53.431 --> 00:00:57.613
I can see the storms where we used to stay

00:01:00.454 --> 00:01:07.500
In the silence of the vacuum, the air is perfectly still

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:12.559
But my shoulders remember the heavy hill

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:20.200
I'm floating in the velvet, I'm drifting in the night

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:24.389
But my hands still brace for the sudden fight

00:01:27.892 --> 00:01:31.395
It's a phantom gravity, pulling at my mind

00:01:31.415 --> 00:01:35.899
A tether to the world that I left behind

00:01:38.508 --> 00:01:42.200
I still feel the anchor's weight

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.200
Even when the chains are gone

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.000
I still feel the hands of fate

00:01:50.075 --> 00:01:54.500
Pushing me to carry on

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:59.500
It doesn't hold me down, it doesn't drag me deep

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.200
But it's a memory the metal wants to keep

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.000
The anchor's weight

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.500
The flashes in the courtroom, the yelling in the hall

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.500
I watch it like a movie projected on the wall

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:25.500
The fire doesn't burn me, the friction isn't real

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.500
But the ghost of the pressure is something I can feel

00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:33.500
We cut the line and fired up the drive

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.500
But the echo of the cage is keeping it alive

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:42.318
It's a phantom gravity, pulling at my mind

00:02:42.378 --> 00:02:47.399
A tether to the world that I left behind

00:02:47.539 --> 00:02:51.500
I still feel the anchor's weight

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.500
Even when the chains are gone

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.000
I still feel the hands of fate

00:02:59.095 --> 00:03:03.500
Pushing me to carry on

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:08.500
It doesn't hold me down, it doesn't drag me deep

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:13.200
But it's a memory the metal wants to keep

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.768
The anchor's weight

00:03:15.768 --> 00:03:46.328
[Piano & Synth Solo]

00:03:46.328 --> 00:03:49.629
I don't need to fight it, I don't need to run

00:03:49.689 --> 00:03:53.709
I'm standing in the light of a different sun

00:03:53.809 --> 00:03:58.650
The metal is cold, the sanctuary is clear

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:08.000
I am the anchor, and I am safe out here

00:04:10.092 --> 00:04:14.000
I still feel the anchor's weight

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.000
Even when the chains are gone

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.500
I still feel the hands of fate

00:04:21.616 --> 00:04:26.000
