00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:31.000
It doesn't hold me down, it doesn't drag me deep

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.800
But it's a memory the metal wants to keep

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.000
The anchor's weight

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.287
Safe out here.

00:04:44.697 --> 00:04:47.500
The phantom gravity.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:50.500
The anchor's weight.

